  "prefLabel": "Ed 607.03 Code of Conduct Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 607.03 Code of Conduct Requirements. Each PEPP shall require each candidate of the program to demonstrate evidence of an understanding of ethical decision making as it relates to the code of conduct specified in Ed 510. The institution shall determine the method of assessment within their candidate assessment system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading heading for Ed 600) #6048, eff 6-2-95; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss by #7923, eff 7-24-03; rpld by #8024, eff 7-1-04\n\nNew. #12813, eff 6-15-19; ss by #13746, eff 9-16-23 (formerly Ed 610.01) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Ed 600)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed600.html"
